  <ownedModelRoots xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellamodeller:SystemEngineering" id="43610ed2-1831-4652-a7f1-b1f44a853c04" name="HACC_MBSE_Architecture" description="&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[BASE]&lt;/strong&gt; MBSE formalization of the InnovAero 2026 proposed&amp;nbsp;Hybrid Acoustic Comfort Cell (HACC) concept. [BASE] elements derive from the submitted concept; [EXT] elements are clearly identified connected-cabin portfolio extensions.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;">
